## =====================================================================
## .NET 10 / ASP.NET Core Razor Pages - Best Practices .gitignore
## =====================================================================
## This file prevents sensitive data, build artifacts, and temporary
## files from being committed to version control.
##
## Last Updated: March 2026
## Target: .NET 10, ASP.NET Core, Razor Pages, ELKH Project
## =====================================================================

# =====================================================================
# User-Specific Files
# =====================================================================
# Visual Studio user preferences and workspace settings
*.rsuser
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# MonoDevelop/Xamarin Studio
*.userprefs

# Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

# VS Code
.vscode/
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json

# Mono auto generated files
mono_crash.*

# =====================================================================
